Secondary Pictures and Scanned Images (SC)\n- Endoscopy (ES)\n- Microscopy (SM, GM)\n- Structured Reports (SR)\n- Encapsulated PDF Documents (OT)\n\nThe viewer can handle many types of DICOM images:\n- Monochromatic (e.g. CR, CT, MR) and color (e.g. US, 3D reconstruction)\n- Static images (e.g. CR, MG, CT) and dynamic sequences (e.g. XA, US)\n- Uncompressed and compressed (RLE, JPEG Lossy, JPEG Lossless, JPEG 2000, JPEG-LS)\n- MPEG2/MPEG4 compressed video files","name":"RadiAnt DICOM Viewer","packageUrl":"https://www.radiantviewer.com/products/radiant-dicom-viewer-standard/","publisher":"Medixant","publisherUrl":"https://www.radiantviewer.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.radiantviewer.com/products/versions/standard/","tags":["dicom","medical-imaging"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"专为医疗影像设计的 PACS DICOM 阅片系统，为您带来非凡体验。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"RadiAnt DICOM Viewer 是一款专用于处理和显示 DICOM 格式（Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine，医学数字成像与通信）医学影像的应用程序。\n该查看器支持从以下来源打开医学影像研究：\n- CD/DVD/蓝光光盘\n- 闪存设备\n- 本地及网络文件夹\n- PACS 存储系统\n\nRadiAnt DICOM Viewer 可显示来自不同成像模态的医学影像研究：\n- 数字 X 线摄影（CR、DX）\n- 乳腺 X 线摄影及数字乳腺断层合成（MG）\n- 计算机断层扫描（CT）\n- 磁共振成像（MR）\n- 正电子发射断层扫描 PET-CT（PT）\n- 超声检查（US、血管内超声 IVUS）\n- 数字血管造影（XA）\n- 伽马相机及核医学成像（NM）\n- 二次采集图像与扫描影像（SC）\n- 内窥镜检查（ES）\n- 显微镜成像（SM、GM）\n- 结构化报告（SR）\n- 封装 PDF 文档（OT）\n\n该查看器支持处理多种类型的 DICOM 影像：\n- 单色影像（如 CR、CT、MR）与彩色影像（如超声、三维重建）\n- 静态图像（如 CR、MG、CT）与动态序列（如 XA、US）\n- 未压缩及压缩格式（RLE、JPEG 有损、JPEG 无损、JPEG 2000、JPEG-LS）\n- MPEG2/MPEG4 压缩视频文件","tags":["dicom","医学成像"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.radiantviewer.com/","releaseDate":"2025-05-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.radiantviewer.com/products/versions/standard/","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Medixant/RadiAntDICOMViewer/2025.2/Medixant.RadiAntDICOMViewer.yaml","sha256":"5dbfbeba726a1df5694be64e831705770713599ab63034